~ start
The Fog-Teller’s valley is carved into jagged stone tonight. Darkness pools between the cliffs and broken rock corridors. Somewhere within its winding misty crags lies a single silver Thread—a fragment of a story long forgotten.

Reclaim the Thread before the watchers of the cliffs detect you.

Let intuition guide your steps through the labyrinth.

Find the Thread. Restore the memory. Become unseen.

=> END
